      "message": "I find this confusing.\n\nI\u0027m not quite sure that checking for \"tv\" string is a good way to decide if device is not mobile. Can build characteristic be upper case ? or just randomly contain tv in it ? \n\nCan you have method called \"is_tv\" instead, and have logic for TV form factor ?",
