      "message": "Same as Jakub, this looks like a hack.\n\nThere are other situation in witch we are doing TV specific code like at the start of profile in the app using the [packageManager](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/Utils.java;l\u003d1279;drc\u003dc4b770ab77ea5c3e62204c8870ebf54dd8b5eb94).\n\nI know that we are here in native (and I am not sure on how to call the packageManager from here), but I think it would be ok to have this value passed as an extra parameter of the init.\n\nWhat do you think ?",
