      "writtenOn": "2024-06-21T22:25:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That a good call.\n\nSince this is gate by a system properties, we are already using a form factor differentiation here.\n\nI believe we could remove all of this and just read the system properties\n\nAre you aware of a cts test that indeed does that ? Can you point it to me ?",
